# All root-level generated JSON — prompts, payloads, results, candidates, audits,
# bench, preds, *.stats.json, etc. splits/*.json lives in a subdir so it is NOT
# matched (kept); profile_rules.json is explicitly un-ignored below.
/*.json
!profile_rules.json

# CSVs and training sets — all generated.
*.csv
*.jsonl

